lyrics_english:
Chorus:
Grace upon grace He poured upon me - Jesus my fountain of mercy;
Guarding and watching me every moment - Filling my vessel with abundant grace.

Verse 1:
Grace is my comfort in times of trouble - Grace is my strength when I am weak;
Grace is my victory in trial and temptation - Grace blesses me in boundless measure.

Verse 2:
All the days of my pilgrimage - Your unfailing grace will follow me;
Faithful until the very end - I will abide in Your eternal grace.

Chorus:
High as the heavens is my Savior's love;
Deep as the ocean is the peace He gives;
Higher than mountains stands His tender grace;
All the days of my life I will worship my King!

Verse 1:
In our youth we remember our faithful Creator;
Walking with joyful vigor in His righteous paths;
Shining as vibrant beacons of light across the world;
Exalting the Holy Name of Jesus at all times!
